"2336","Aisha said: The Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him) was seized by pain in his side, and it became very severe. One day it seized him, and the Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him) fainted, until we thought he had died on the bed. So we forced medicine into his mouth. When he recovered, he realized we had forced medicine on him. He said: ""Did you think that Allah would afflict me with pleurisy? Allah would not give it authority over me. By Allah, no one will remain in the house except you will force medicine on him, except my uncle Al-Abbas."" She said: So no one remained in the house except they were forced to take medicine. Then a woman from among his wives said: ""I am fasting!"" They said: ""Do you think we will leave you? When the Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him) said: 'No one will remain in the house except he will be forced to take medicine.'"" So we forced her to take medicine while she was fasting."
